CONTRIBUTING.md:26:**Test traceability.** `re-lint/require-spec-link` wants every test to be cited from a spec or ADR, as `([validated by](path/to/test.ts#L12))` in the statement it validates. A test that validates nothing a spec claims is asking whether it belongs in the traceable suite.
